    "description": "CondenSimAdapter is a Python package designed to facilitate multiscale molecular dynamics simulations, specifically bridging the gap between coarse-grained (CG) and all-atom (AA) simulations for studying protein condensates. It uses an SE(3)-transformer-based backmapping coupled with a physics-inspired optimization protocol to resolve structural clashes during the simulation process.",
